<Layout title="How Pre-Foreclosure Works in Texas and What Your Options Are" description="Falling behind on your mortgage in Texas doesn't mean foreclosure is inevitable. Here's how pre-foreclosure works and what options are available to homeowners.">

  <section class="page-hero navy-bg">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="/blog" class="back-link">&larr; Back to Blog</a>
